// From the law, Article 4, in centimeters: 250 long and 125 wide, three stripes of 40 with
// red edges of 2.5 on the white. The crescent and stars fit a 75 x 30 rectangle in the
// middle of the blue, 20 from the hoist, so it runs 20 to 95 and 5 to 35.
//   crescent: fits a circle of diameter 30, so its center is 20 + 15 = 35
//   stars: fit circles of diameter 6, with 6 between circles, so centers step 12
//   rows of 3, 4 and 5 end at the rectangle's fly side: 95 - 3 = 92; rows at 8, 20, 32
//   the 5-star row starts 3.5 past the crescent's lower tip: 44 - 3 - 3.5 = 37.5
// The cut circle isn't in the text. The schematic annex draws two equal circles 5 apart,
// whose tips lie at 35 + 5/2 = 37.5, as the text needs. Fitting circles to the annex's
// colored image gave radii 14.8 to 15 and an offset of 4.7.
vexyl 1
meta {
  name "Uzbekistan"
  date "1991-11-18"
  encoder "Naomi Persephone Amethyst"
  license "CC-BY-SA-4.0"
  render-license "CC0-1.0"
  source "https://lex.uz/docs/-100122"
  source "https://lex.uz/files/8096765.jpg"
  source "https://lex.uz/files/5783098"
  source "https://lex.uz/files/5783125"
  source "https://www.crwflags.com/fotw/flags/uz.html"
  note "All sizes are in the law's Article 4 or its schematic annex. The law gives no shades, so the hex values are sampled from the colored image annexed to it, which is a GIF rather than a color specification. The Album's values are recorded as references: its blue is far from both the annex and its own Pantone number."
  law "Law No. 407-XII on the State Flag of the Republic of Uzbekistan, 18 November 1991, as amended to 2024" {
    source "https://lex.uz/docs/-100122"
    source "https://lex.uz/files/8096765.jpg"
  }
}
palette {
  blue "#008baf" {
    reference "Album des Pavillons 2023, via FOTW" "Pantone 313c, CMYK 72-41-0-0, RGB 67-137-221"
  }
  red "#dd2a1b" {
    reference "Album des Pavillons 2023, via FOTW" "Pantone 186c, CMYK 10-100-74-2, RGB 210-16-52"
  }
  white "#ffffff"
  green "#54bd06" {
    reference "Album des Pavillons 2023, via FOTW" "Pantone 361c, CMYK 70-0-100-0, RGB 18-173-43"
  }
}
proportion hoist=125 fly=250

bars blue red white red green {
  ratio 40 2.5 40 2.5 40
}
charge crescent white {
  radius 15
  inner 15
  offset 5
  at fly=35 hoist=20
}
charge star white {
  radius 3
  at fly=68 hoist=8
  repeat line count=3 fly=12
}
charge star white {
  radius 3
  at fly=56 hoist=20
  repeat line count=4 fly=12
}
charge star white {
  radius 3
  at fly=44 hoist=32
  repeat line count=5 fly=12
}

// Article 4: the crescent and stars are near the pole on both faces, as the annex shows.
reverse mirror
